`Record<string, unknown>` is what trips TS4111 on `.backgroundColor`, `.layout` and `.id` further down. Typing these as `DotLottieSolidProps` (here and in the two mock signatures below) clears all three:

```ts
import type { DotLottieSolidProps } from '../src/dotlottie';

const captured: { canvasProps?: DotLottieSolidProps; playerProps?: DotLottieSolidProps } = {};
```
